1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Before you decide what to automate, ask the people who do the work.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,613
Share one link.

3
00:00:09,613 --> 00:00:18,000
Your team answers an AI interviewer on a phone or a laptop, no account needed.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:28,000
One question at a time, the same template for everyone, and it is instructed never to ask where AI should go.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The answers are grouped, counted and scored across the whole campaign, and a quote or a department shows only when, by default, at least three people are behind it.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
A promising opportunity becomes a requirements interview, and then a versioned specification your developers, or your coding agent, can build from.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,620
Built to run on a server you operate, with the providers you choose.

8
00:00:55,620 --> 00:01:00,000
Understand the problem before deciding what to build.
